  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">for support of the Gender Funders CoLab</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This grant to Panorama Global will support the Gender Funders CoLab, an independent women&#x2019;s rights funder network. The Gender Funders CoLab supports its members to learn, collaborate, and leverage more and better resources for the women&#x2019;s rights field. The organization will pursue these objectives through diverse activities such as member meetings, data and evidence gathering, member-led working groups, aligned funding, strategic partnerships, and leveraging resources through pooled funds and other funds. (Strategy: Opportunity)</narrative>
  </description>
